      "statusChangeID": null,
      "value": "As a map maker, I see this heavily abused blacklisting someone from the world and would cause people to take your reputation and drag it to the ground, thus no one would want to visit your world anymore. I don't have a problem kicking someone out of my world if they have me blocked as most do block owner and start crashing the whole lobby BS which is easy report.\n\nBut maybe adding people as a can kick out of world option isn't that bad, but limit to 3 per world.",
      "viewerReactions": null
    },
