      "spam": false,
      "statusChangeID": null,
      "value": "No thanks. I can see this becoming a disaster. Imagine a hypothetical situation where a single person controls all of the most popular maps in VRChat (not the case right now, it's a hypothetical). They could effectively ban you from the game by banning you from their world. Too much drama, too much power.\n\nWhat this game needs more of is proper moderation. Rather than putting this power in the hands of any random world creator, VRC has to step up their game and start *moderating* it. The \"hackers and crashers\" you mention are already violating the TOS.",
      "viewerReactions": null
    },
