      "sourceLink": null,
      "spam": false,
      "statusChangeID": null,
      "value": "I gave it a second thought and maybe a personal blacklist is what Torbi needs/means. So he can blacklist someone and whenever he opens a new instance of a world this person can't join his instance(not world). Of course there needs to be some information like \"the creator of that instance blacklisted you\" if someone unwanted wants to join. That way it is still possible for those people to open a new instance or join others in this world as long as Mr.Torbi didn't create the instance.",
