      "sourceLink": null,
      "spam": false,
      "statusChangeID": null,
      "value": "With the new Udon, this has me wondering. I have not had a chance to play with Udon yet as I don't have the time to learn how it works right now. But as I have seen in other VRC worlds, specifically CTF or Steel and Gold, the world can get the usernames of people for team building.\nWhat if this concept could be applied so that the map gets the username of every user that joins and if they match a list it will automatically put them in a box with a sign 'you are blacklisted from this world'.",
